<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>水气 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B0%B4%E6%B0%94/</link><description>Recent content in 水气 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Mon, 06 Apr 2026 11:08:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B0%B4%E6%B0%94/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>水气病：外感水邪的辨治体系</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/yihua-9-sqbwgsxdbztx/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Apr 2026 11:05:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/yihua-9-sqbwgsxdbztx/</guid><description>水气病，是指由外感风寒暑湿等六淫邪气侵袭人体，导致水液代谢失常，停聚于体内不同部位而形成的一类疾病。张仲景在《金匮要略》中将其与“痰饮病”明确区分：饮病多由内伤七情、脏腑功能失调而发，属内因；水气病则由外感邪气引发，多兼表证，属外因。此分类体现了中医“审因论治”的核心思想。</description></item></channel></rss>